    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A powerful automatic rifle meant to maximize firing rate.</p><p>Ammo Type: Bullets</p><p>Reload: 40 shots (action)</p><p>Damage: 2d8 piercing</p><p>Range: 100/400 ft</p><p><strong>Heavy:</strong> A heavy weapon's size make it too large for a small creature to use effectively. Small creatures have disadvantage on attack rolls with heavy weapons.</p><p><strong>Automatic:</strong> When you make an attack with this weapon, you can choose to make two attacks instead with a -5 penalty to your attack rolls. You cannot move between these attacks.</p><p><strong>Strength 13:</strong> Any creature using this weapon has disadvantage on attack rolls with it if its Strength score is less than the value of the strength requirement. Furthermore, when making a ranged attack with this weapon, you may use your Strength modifier instead of your Dexterity modifier for attack rolls.</p><p><strong>Reload (Action):</strong> A reloadable weapon can be used to make a number of attacks before it must be reloaded. Reloading this weapon requires a free hand, and takes an action.</p>",
